<li></li>
<li>Meiksins Wood, Ellen. (1972). Mind and Politics: An Approach to the Meaning of Liberal and Socialist Individualism. University of California Press.</li>
<li>Shanahan, Daniel. (1991) Toward a Genealogy of Individualism. Amherst, MA: University of Massachusetts Press. .</li>
<li>Watt, Ian. (1996) Myths of Modern Individualism. Cambridge: Cambridge University Press. .</li>
<li>Barzilai, Gad. (2003). Communities and Law. Ann Arbor: University of Michigan Press. .</li>
<li>Fruehwald, Edwin, "A Biological Basis of Rights", 19 Southern California Interdisciplinary Law Journal 195 (2010).</li>
</ul>

